  m_Name: GemMerchant_PostLevel2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  merchantTextLines:
  - "Ah, the flame grows brighter, and so does the crowd. Just don\u2019t let them
    drain <dangle a=.2>too many</dangle> of my gems."
  - "But again, there are still others out there, waiting to be found. Don\u2019t
    keep them waiting."
  - 'You now have a <wiggle a=.05 f=2>choice</wiggle>. '
  - "Continue <slide a=.2>deeper</slide> in The Lost Greens , where you\u2019ll find
    The Watcher. She\u2019ll help you strengthen your emberlings."
  - Or step through the <slide a=.2>new portal</slide> to The Sacred Temple, where
    The Burdened Architect will shape your future camps.
  - "<wave a=.2 f=1.5>Now go</wave>. The flame doesn\u2019t wait for the hesitant."
  showShopAfterDialog: 0
